  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Prospects-P10004407-001</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of our funding is to finance (i) the construction of collection centres for warehousing and transport of produce, (ii) distribution centres with cold storage and a fleet of refrigerated trucks for managing logistics and transport, (iii) the rollout of retail stores in urban areas of Mumbai, Pune and Nashik and (iv) the expansion of the existing production plant.</narrative>
  </description>
